<title>UK: Semple Cochrane jumps after newsletter tip.</title>
<headline>Semple Cochrane jumps after newsletter tip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in engineering services group Semple Cochrane Plc jumped 22.5p to 269 by 1030 GMT after being tipped in a newsletter on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's been a bit of interest because it was mentioned in the tipsheet Techinvest this morning,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>Semple Cochrane made its debut on the London Stock Exchange on December 2.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
